WEBVTT

00:01:58.739 --> 00:02:04.036
So if I took all of us to a city and said,

00:02:04.078 --> 00:02:06.122
"Which bit would you like to go to?

00:02:06.164 --> 00:02:09.667
Would you like to go to the old bit

00:02:09.667 --> 00:02:10.960
or the new bit?"

00:02:11.919 --> 00:02:13.296
(Laughter)

00:02:13.337 --> 00:02:15.256
You've given me my answer already.

00:02:16.507 --> 00:02:18.885
We all know instinctively,

00:02:18.926 --> 00:02:21.888
the majority are going
to pick the old bit.

00:02:22.471 --> 00:02:23.639
Why?

00:02:23.681 --> 00:02:27.685
Because we all know the new bit
will be characterless and boring.

00:02:28.436 --> 00:02:32.857
So where did all the lumps
and bumps on buildings go?